# characterization baseline: 14-tariff-called-when-note-starts-at-offset-zero
# A fault note beginning exactly at offset 0 is missed by the strpos truthiness bug, so no HTTP call is made (known issue 10). postedTariff therefore stays null, which still passes the alert gate: alerted_at is set and fault_note is not persisted.
# documents: docs/known-issues.md#10-strpos-truthiness-bug-in-fault-detection
